  m_text: 'Press "F" to open this page again, and again to hide.


    Press "Left-Shift"
    to sprint.


    You sure are fast, but don''t underestimate those vegetables.
    To escape it''s chase, is to run into any small rooms


    Find the other kids
    and escape, good luck.'
